WaifuFinder modifications:
- Reimplemented candidate evaluation, ranked reduction, and move execution in
  native Swift and Metal for a symmetric open path with free endpoints.
- Removed vehicle, depot, capacity, pickup/delivery, route-dimension and CUDA
  bookkeeping. No CUDA, RAFT, RMM, Thrust or CUB implementation is included.
- Uses independent initial routes and one accepted move per route per snapshot.
- Added Apple Vision metric validation, GPU feature distances, bounded candidate
  evaluation for large sets, cancellation, CPU fallback, and original-image IDs.

This is a specialized port of the routing 2-opt search, not the complete NVIDIA
cuOpt solver, a binary distribution of cuOpt, or an NVIDIA-supported Metal backend.
Files covered: Sources/Waifu/Grouping/CuOptTSP.swift and CuOptMetalTSP.swift.
